Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:17:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] entrypoints: native Granian mTLS + health-only port
 (transport 0001)

Ports the KubeTEE east-west mTLS transport boundary (nim/SGLANG-MTLS-DEPLOYMENT.md)
onto v0.5.23 as the transport/ layer: serving.py flags, serving_hook validation +
self_check_client_cert, health_check.UvicornHealthServer (health-only plaintext
listener), http_server Granian mTLS + inbound verify derivation. Model-layer
patches (DFlash penalties, MiMo tool-loop) stay OUT of this layer; applied
a-la-carte via docker/kubetee-mtls-overlay when a repro requires them.
